(Honey is a broad spectrum antimicrobial agent which can enhance wound healing. A beneficial ) Tj T*
(effect in cancer has been shown in cell cultures and in animal studies and a number of further ) Tj T*
(nutritional and physiological effects of relevance to health and function have been shown for ) Tj T*
(honey. A representative sub-sample of 665 men within the Caerphilly Cohort kept a weighed ) Tj T*
(dietary record for seven days. Risk factors for vascular and other diseases in 41 men who ) Tj T*
(recorded eating honey suggest that these men were on the whole healthier than the 624 men who ) Tj T*
(had not recorded honey consumption. All-cause mortality during 25 years of follow-up was ) Tj T*
(considerably lower in the men who had consumed honey, the hazard ratio, adjusted for a number ) Tj T*
(of possible confounding factors, being 0.44 \(95% confidence limits 0.23, 0.86; P<0.017\). ) Tj T*
(Because of the small number of subjects and of deaths in this study, further data from other ) Tj T*
(large cohorts will be required before any effect upon mortality and other health effects of ) Tj T*
(honey consumption can be adequately evaluated.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
